# Butler Routes - The Barrens recipes and patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics and formulas whose SOURCE
# is physically in The Barrens (zone key 1413), verified against the
# local Forever game data (questie-forever item, vendor and drop
# tables). 25 recipes are vendor-sold (no Alliance-only vendor among
# them) and 5 drop from named in-zone mobs; every other dropped recipe
# is a generic multi-zone world drop (see
# docs/barrens-companions-inventory.md), and quest records carry no
# reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md). The three
# rare-signature world drops (Gesharahan, Trigore, Dishu) ride the
# rares companion, not this one. No Blacksmithing plan and no
# Fishing-specific recipe has a Barrens source in the data - stated,
# not padded. Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own
# profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its profession;
# other characters skip it cleanly.
guide butler-routes-completionist/barrens-recipes
title The Barrens - Recipes & Patterns
levels 10-25
zone The Barrens
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords barrens, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Cooking - Tari'qa (Crossroads)

  zone map 1413

  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 3482 -- Tari'qa (51.68,30.04)
  buy 5486 "Recipe: Strider Stew"
  buy 5488 "Recipe: Crispy Lizard Tail"
  note Tari'qa (Horde) sells both recipes at the Crossroads; nothing else in the data sells them. Stock class unconfirmed.

