step Tailoring - Grimtotem Geomancer (drop)

  zone map 1413

  when skill Tailoring 1

  loop
  goto 44.1,95.6
  goto 44.4,94.4
  goto 44.5,94.7
  goto 45.3,96
  goto 46.2,96.6
  goto 46.6,94.2
  goto 46.6,97.9
  goto 46.9,94.3
  collect 5773 "Pattern: Robes of Arcana" optional
  note Dropped by Grimtotem Geomancers in the far south (also drops in 3 other zones) - the core's Protect Kaya chain already fights Grimtotem. No vendor sells it.

